"Years later the young Questors Vira and Liren pass his advice on to the Heirs."
"In the Ostren war he leads a nine-person mage-killing squad in three teams of three."
"A utility skill of his links his squad in silent speech, and all of them fly by enchantment."
"He loots a glowing bow from an enemy corpse in that war."
"His squad could conquer most nations in a day."
"At the Conclave he spars Aarl against builds, guards the Ashen seats, and is a reliable duelist."
"Nine years later he is an ally of Colborn behind the Continuance Council."
